{"id":"fremd","lemma":"fremd","pos":"adj","rank":1531,"glosses":["strange","foreign","external"],"ipa":"/fʁɛmt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/De-fremd.ogg/De-fremd.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"fremder","superlative":"am fremdesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich war ein Fremder.","en":"I was a stranger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393411","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Er ist mir nicht fremd.","en":"He is no stranger to me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Ein Fremder steht vor dem Haus.","en":"A stranger is standing in front of the house.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"Der Mann war vollkommen fremd.","en":"The man was a total stranger.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"perfect"},null]},{"text":"Er ist ein völlig Fremder für mich.","en":"He is a complete stranger to me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"completely"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]}]}